# BENEFITS OF DRUM AND DANCE INCURSIONS

_Connect  through movement & rhythm - Expand the body’s movement - Coordination & spatial awareness - Self-confidence & individual expression - Appreciation of different cultural practices - Individual expression through movement - Unity with fellow students - Physical & mental release_

